From d333924be6634c26950adf28654810ac1bece5a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:48:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] Clocking in after resolving a dangling clock sends one
 edit

