The server is downloaded into a folder of the package's release, so a package updated to another release downloads its own (and the old one goes). A prompt with completions offers them in the quick panel, its first item opening the input panel to type anything (the tags picked join those there); a prompt that ends in `: ` or `? ` gets no other `:`. TESTING.org no longer asks Sublime Text for the calendar's journal days.

